{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Looking for a lighthearted Metroidvania that's isn't gloomy? We've got you covered.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> is a fast-paced, gun-jumping Metroidvania with a unique, retro-inspired pixel art style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Welcome_Banner.gif?t=1752245805\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot, jump, and explore your way through the world of Dewdrop\u2014a interconnected land filled with hidden secrets, diverse biomes, strange monsters, and even stranger inhabitants.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/DewdropDynasty_Exploration.gif?t=1752245805\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">  </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With so much to discover, bosses to face, and puzzles to solve, <i>Dewdrop Dynasty</i> bursts with charm, challenge, and fast-paced fun. <strong>The world of Dewdrop won\u2019t explore itself\u2014so what are you waiting for?</strong> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/GameFeatures_Banner.gif?t=1752245805\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/B33.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Harness your inner gunslinger with gun-jumping, pistol-whipping action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Ticket.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Collect and redeem tickets for fun prizes from vending machines</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Slipshot.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Unlock and wield unique items and strange abilities</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Hat.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Wear a variety of silly, stylish, and occasionally useful hats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Strawberry.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Enjoy a colorful pixel art style bursting with personality</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Token.png?t=1752245805\" /></div> Mark up your map as you explore the world of Dewdrop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Enemy.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Face off against bosses and wacky enemies using items collected along the way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/HeartClover.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Explore a lighthearted world full of charm, humor, and quirky characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1444080/extras/Music.png?t=1752245805\" /></div>\u00a0Plus, an original soundtrack composed by the talented <strong>Peter Reid Jones</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><i